"settings.codeReview.repository.instructions.description":`Ku dar tilmaamaha dib-u-eegista faylka AGENTS.md ee ku jira kaydkan koodhka`,"settings.codeReview.repository.instructions.fileName":`AGENTS.md`,"settings.codeReview.repository.instructions.open":`Fur faylka`,"settings.codeReview.repository.instructions.title":`Tilmaamaha dib-u-eegista`,"settings.codeReview.repository.loading":`Waxaa la soo rarayaa setinka kaydka koodhka…`,"settings.codeReview.repository.manualReviewNotice":`Weli waxaad codsan kartaa dib-u-eegis adigoo xusaya @codex`,"settings.codeReview.repository.manualSeverity":`Heerka darnaanta ugu hooseeya ee lagu soo sheego dib-u-eegisyada gacanta lagu codsado`,"settings.codeReview.repository.manualSeverity.description":`Dooro heerka darnaanta ugu hooseeya ee ay tahay in Codex uu ku soo sheego dib-u-eegisyada lagu codsado @codex`,"settings.codeReview.repository.mergeAdmin":`Maamulayaasha kaydka koodhka ee GitHub oo keliya ayaa beddeli kara ilaalinta isku-darka iyo heerka darnaanta ee keena xannibaadda`,"settings.codeReview.repository.mergeProtection":`Ilaalinta isku-darka`,"settings.codeReview.repository.mergeProtection.description":`Daabac hubinta GitHub ah ee fashilanta marka Dib-u-eegista Amnigu soo sheegto cillad darnaanteedu gaarto ama ka sarreyso heerka xannibaadda. Si aad u xannibto isku-darista, sidoo kale hubintan ka dhig mid khasab ah gudaha GitHub.`,"settings.codeReview.repository.mergeProtection.reportingRequired":`Si aad u daarto ilaalinta isku-darka, dooro heerka darnaanta xannibaadda oo la mid ah ama ka sarreeya heerka darnaanta warbixinta otomaatiga ah`,"settings.codeReview.repository.newPath":`Horgalaha jidka kaydka koodhka`,"settings.codeReview.repository.newPath.placeholder":`src/`,"settings.codeReview.repository.pathRule.label":`{field, select, auto_severity_threshold {Otomaatig ah} other {Gacanta}}`,"settings.codeReview.repository.pathRule.severity":`Heerka darnaanta dib-u-eegista {field, select, auto_severity_threshold {otomaatigga ah} other {gacanta lagu sameeyo}} ee {path}`,"settings.codeReview.repository.pathRules":`Beddelidda heerka darnaanta warbixinta ee ku salaysan jidka`,"settings.codeReview.repository.pathRules.description":`Beddel heerka darnaanta ee loo soo sheego jidada gaar ah oo ku jira kaydka koodhka.`,"settings.codeReview.repository.permissions":`Si aad u beddesho setinkan, waxaad u baahan tahay oggolaansho aad ku maamusho kaydka koodhka ama aad koodh ugu dirto.`,"settings.codeReview.repository.removePath":`Saar`,"settings.codeReview.repository.retryAction":`{kind, select, load {Dib isugu day} other {Cusboonaysii}}`,"settings.codeReview.repository.savePathEdit":`{adding, select, true {Ku dar} other {Keydi}}`,"settings.codeReview.repository.scope":`Dib u eeg`,"settings.codeReview.repository.scope.option":`{scope, select, everyone {Dhammaan PR-yada} team {PR-yada Kooxda} other {Raac dookhyada shakhsi ahaaneed}}`,"settings.codeReview.repository.securityTitle":`Dib u eeg nuglaanta amniga`,"settings.codeReview.repository.securityTrigger":`Kiciye`,"settings.codeReview.repository.severity.option.v2":`{value, select, critical {Aad u daran} high {Sare} medium {Dhexdhexaad} low {Hoose} inherit {Isticmaal dejinta kaydka koodhka} other {Aan la garaneyn}}`,"settings.codeReview.repository.subtitle":`Maamul sida uu Codex dib ugu eego kaydkan koodhka`,"settings.codeReview.repository.threatPath":`Jidka faylka moodelka khataraha ee ku jira kaydkan koodhka`,"settings.codeReview.repository.threatPath.description":`Jidka faylka waxaa lagu saleeyaa galka ugu sarreeya ee kaydka koodhka. Haddii aan la cayimin, Codex wuxuu dib-u-eegis kasta u abuuraa moodel khataraha ah.`,"settings.codeReview.repository.threatPath.placeholder":`docs/threat-model.md`,"settings.codeReview.repository.threatSource":`Isha moodelka khatarta`,"settings.codeReview.repository.threatSource.option":`{value, select, codex_security {Codex Security} other {Faylka kaydka koodhka}}`,"settings.codeReview.repository.trigger.option":`{value, select, personal {Raac dookhyada shakhsi ahaaneed} pr_open {Marka PR la furo} every_push {Mar kasta oo push la sameeyo} smart_detect {Ogaansho caqli leh (Tijaabo)} code_review {Mar kasta oo dib-u-eegista koodhka la sameeyo} other {Aan la garaneyn}}`,"settings.codeReview.retry":`Dib isugu day`,"settings.codeReview.save.error":`Lama keydin karin habeynta dib-u-eegista koodhka`,"settings.codeReview.security.autoReview.description":`Haddii dejinta dib-u-eegista kaydka koodhka ay ka duwan tahay doorbidkaaga shakhsiyeed, dejinta kaydka koodhka ayaa mudnaanta leh`,"settings.codeReview.security.autoReview.label":`Dib-u-eegista amniga ee otomaatiga ah`,"settings.codeReview.security.autoSeverity.description":`Dooro heerka halista ugu hooseeya ee loo soo sheegay dib-u-eegisyada otomaatiga ah`,"settings.codeReview.security.autoSeverity.label":`Heerka ugu yar ee darnaanta ee dib-u-eegista otomaatiga ah lagu soo sheego`,"settings.codeReview.security.billingNotice.body":`Tijaabadaada hordhaca ah ee Dib-u-eegista Amniga waxay sii soconaysaa illaa {billingStartsAt}. Intaas ka dib, Dib-u-eegisyada Amniga waxay si otomaatig ah u isticmaali doonaan qoondadaada Codex iyo kiridhityadaada si waafaqsan setinadaada biil-gareynta.`,"settings.codeReview.security.billingNotice.pricing":`Eeg qiimeynta`,"settings.codeReview.security.billingNotice.title":`Biil-gareynta Dib-u-eegista Amniga ayaa isbeddelaysa`,"settings.codeReview.security.credits.description":`Dib-u-eegisyada amniga waxay isticmaalaan qoondada Codex ee la wadaago ee akoonkan. Daar tan si aad u isticmaasho kiridhityada ka dib marka ay qoondadaasi dhammaato. Tani waxay sidoo kale khusaysaa dib-u-eegisyada amniga ee 'Dib u eeg qof walba' ee aad hawlgelisay. <link>Eeg isticmaalka</link>.`,"settings.codeReview.security.credits.label":`U adeegso kiridhityada dib-u-eegisyada amniga`,"settings.codeReview.security.manualSeverity.description":`Dooro heerka khatarta ugu hooseeya ee laga soo sheegay dib-u-eegisyada lagu codsaday @codex`